{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "\"Test everything\" with no screen named.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "화면 이름 없이 \"전부 테스트해 줘\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "#": {
      "comment": "A column showing the step number.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "%@ (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (%lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ chars captured": {
      "comment": "A label showing the number of characters in the accessibility snapshot.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "%@ · %@": {
      "comment": "A subheading with the platform and the date the audit was run. The first argument is the platform name. The second argument is the date the audit was run.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@ · %lld elements · %lld×%lldpt": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · %@ · 요소 %lld개 · %lld×%lldpt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@ · %lld steps": {
      "comment": "A group box that displays the plan's name, platform, and steps.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ · %2$@ · %3$lld steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@%@": {
      "comment": "A checkmark next to the device name if it's booted.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {
      "comment": "A table showing the steps of a build or test run.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "%lld errors · %lld warnings · %lld info": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "오류 %lld · 경고 %lld · 정보 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld findings": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "발견 항목 %lld개"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld steps": {
      "comment": "A label showing the number of steps in a test plan. The argument is the number of steps in the plan.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "%lld. %@": {
      "comment": "The step number and a description of the step.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$lld. %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility trees (%lld)": {
      "comment": "A group of accessibility audit results.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "After the reply": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "답변을 받은 뒤"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "전체 (%lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer Claude directly in the terminal and paste its next reply here. Or answer in the form that appears on the left and press \"Copy prompt\" again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "터미널에서 Claude에게 바로 답하고 다음 답변을 여기에 붙여넣으세요. 또는 왼쪽에 생기는 폼에 답을 적고 \"Copy prompt\"를 다시 누르면 됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any Claude Code session works: your project's terminal is best because Claude can read the app code and add missing identifiers. Claude replies with one JSON object.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "어떤 Claude Code 세션이든 됩니다. 프로젝트 터미널이 가장 좋은데, Claude가 앱 코드를 읽고 빠진 식별자를 직접 추가할 수 있기 때문입니다. Claude는 JSON 객체 하나로 답합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Human Interface Guidelines": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 휴먼 인터페이스 가이드라인"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask Claude": {
      "comment": "A button that triggers the Claude prompt-building process.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Ask Claude Code yourself and paste the plan": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code에게 직접 요청하고 플랜 붙여넣기"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask Claude Code yourself, paste the plan here": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code에게 직접 요청하고, 플랜은 여기에 붙여넣기"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask Claude to diagnose": {
      "comment": "A button that triggers the app to ask Claude to diagnose a build failure.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Ask Claude to review": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude에게 검토 요청"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking for coordinates.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "좌표로 탭해 달라는 요청."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assuming Claude knows your test accounts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude가 테스트 계정을 안다고 가정하기."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audit First Screen Against HIG": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "첫 화면 HIG 검사"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audit first screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "첫 화면 검사"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "피할 것"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boot & open Simulator": {
      "comment": "A button that boots a simulator and opens it.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Boot the simulator and install your app (⌘R in Xcode) to see it here.": {
      "comment": "A description of the installed apps on the selected simulator.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Build prompt": {
      "comment": "A button that builds a prompt for Claude Code.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Builds a prompt with this plan attached (see Claude Code tab)": {
      "comment": "A button that builds a prompt with the current plan attached.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Bundle identifier": {
      "comment": "A label for the bundle identifier field in the target picker.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Capture Accessibility Snapshot": {
      "comment": "A button that captures an accessibility snapshot.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Capture snapshot": {
      "comment": "A button that captures the app's accessibility tree for Claude to analyze.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Check the validation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "검증 결과를 확인하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose…": {
      "comment": "A button that opens a file chooser to select a path.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Claude Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude also has %lld question%@ — see the left pane.": {
      "comment": "A subheading that indicates that Claude also has questions.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Claude also has %1$lld question%2$@ — see the left pane."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude asked %lld question%@. Answer them on the left and press \"Send answers\".": {
      "comment": "A subheading that displays the number of questions Claude asked.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Claude asked %1$lld question%2$@. Answer them on the left and press \"Send answers\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude did not follow the JSON protocol; raw reply:": {
      "comment": "A label displayed when the Claude assistant's response is not in the expected JSON format.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Claude needs some input from you": {
      "comment": "A heading for a section of a view that asks the user for input.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Claude will either ask questions or guess. Name the screens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude가 질문을 하거나 추측하게 됩니다. 화면을 지정하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude's reply": {
      "comment": "The heading for the Claude's reply section.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Copy": {
      "comment": "A button that copies the text to the clipboard.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "복사"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy CLAUDE.md snippet": {
      "comment": "A button that copies a CLAUDE.md snippet to the clipboard.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Copy Claude's reply, paste it into \"Paste a reply from Claude Code\" on the right, press \"Parse reply\", then \"Save and run\". A bare plan JSON without the wrapper is recognized too. The run appears in the Runs tab with step results and screenshots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude의 답을 복사해 오른쪽 \"Paste a reply from Claude Code\"에 붙여넣고 \"Parse reply\" → \"Save and run\"을 누르세요. 감싸는 틀 없이 플랜 JSON만 붙여넣어도 인식합니다. 결과는 실행 탭에 스텝별 상태와 스크린샷으로 나옵니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy JSON": {
      "comment": "A button that copies the plan's JSON representation to the clipboard.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Copy findings JSON": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "결과 JSON 복사"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy prompt": {
      "comment": "A button that copies the prompt to the clipboard.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Copy template with plan format": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "플랜 형식 포함해서 템플릿 복사"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy text only": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "텍스트만 복사"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create one, import from Claude, or drop a JSON into the Inbox folder.": {
      "comment": "A description of the available actions for the plans view.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Derived data": {
      "comment": "A label for the derived data folder.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Destination: %@": {
      "comment": "A label showing the selected destination for the plan. The argument is the name of the selected device.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Device": {
      "comment": "A label for the device picker in the sidebar.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Devices": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "기기"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doctor": {
      "comment": "A section in the settings view that runs checks and displays output.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Does your app violate the HIG?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 앱, HIG를 위배하지 않았나요?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "완료"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the target app's bundle identifier in the sidebar first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "먼저 사이드바에 대상 앱의 번들 ID를 입력하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Errors": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "오류"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Example request": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "요청 예시"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extra context (credentials for test accounts, which screen, known identifiers…)": {
      "comment": "A section for providing additional context for the test.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Extra context:": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "추가 컨텍스트:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FAIL": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "실패"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FAILED": {
      "comment": "A label displayed when a build fails.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Filter": {
      "comment": "A label for a picker that filters findings by severity.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "First run compiles the Runner; later runs are much faster.": {
      "comment": "A description of the performance of the first run of a test plan.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Folders": {
      "comment": "A section for the user to see and interact with the paths of the app's folders.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "For example: launch → General → About. One flow per plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "예: 실행 → 일반 → 정보. 플랜 하나에 흐름 하나."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For macOS, type the bundle identifier of the app you want to test.": {
      "comment": "A description of how to find the bundle identifier of an app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Generate with xcodegen": {
      "comment": "A button that generates the Xcode project using xcodegen.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Generated from Runner/project.yml with XcodeGen. The Runner hosts the XCUITest interpreter for every platform.": {
      "comment": "A description of the XcodeGen-generated Runner project.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Grounding": {
      "comment": "A heading for the section of the Claude Assistant where you can configure the environment in which Claude Code will be run.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "HIG": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HIG"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HIG audits": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HIG 검사"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it works": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "진행 방식"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identifier scheme: screen.element (for example settings.general). No login required. Device: the simulator selected in the sidebar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "식별자 규칙: screen.element (예: settings.general). 로그인 불필요. 기기: 사이드바에서 선택한 시뮬레이터."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the run fails, open it in the Runs tab and press \"Ask Claude to diagnose\": the prompt with step results and the accessibility tree at the failure point is built for you. \"Copy prompt\", paste it into Claude Code, paste the corrected plan back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "실행이 실패하면 실행 탭에서 열고 \"Ask Claude to diagnose\"를 누르세요. 스텝 결과와 실패 시점의 접근성 트리가 담긴 프롬프트가 만들어집니다. \"Copy prompt\"로 복사해 Claude Code에 붙여넣고, 수정된 플랜을 다시 붙여넣으면 됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you prefer to type your own request in Claude Code, it must still know the plan format and the reply shape. \"Copy template with plan format\" copies this text followed by the plan reference and the reply format, so the result can be pasted here unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code에 요청을 직접 타이핑하더라도 Claude는 플랜 형식과 답변 모양을 알아야 합니다. \"플랜 형식 포함해서 템플릿 복사\"는 이 텍스트 뒤에 플랜 레퍼런스와 답변 형식을 붙여 복사하므로, 결과를 그대로 여기에 붙여넣을 수 있습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inbox (drop plans here)": {
      "comment": "A label for the folder where plans are created.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Include accessibility snapshot": {
      "comment": "A checkbox that lets the user choose whether to include a snapshot of the app's UI when requesting a Claude prompt.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Info": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "정보"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed apps on selected simulator": {
      "comment": "A heading for the list of apps installed on the selected simulator.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Keep a plan under about 15 steps. Long flows are hard to diagnose when they fail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "플랜은 15스텝 안쪽으로. 긴 흐름은 실패했을 때 원인 찾기가 어렵습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Known identifiers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "알고 있는 식별자."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch the app and dump its accessibility tree so Claude sees real identifiers": {
      "comment": "A tooltip for the \"Capture snapshot\" button.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Launch the app, go from the first screen to General and then About, and audit every screen against the HIG along the way. Add a higAudit and a screenshot per screen. On About, verify that the text \"Software Version\" is visible. Use failOn \"error\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "앱을 실행해서 첫 화면 → 일반 → 정보 순서로 이동하면서 각 화면을 HIG 기준으로 검사해 줘. 화면마다 higAudit과 screenshot을 넣어 줘. 정보 화면에서는 \"소프트웨어 버전\" 텍스트가 보이는지 확인해 줘. failOn은 \"error\"로."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch the target app and check its first screen against the HIG rules (⇧⌘H)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "대상 앱을 실행하고 첫 화면을 HIG 규칙으로 검사합니다 (⇧⌘H)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launching the app and auditing its first screen…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "앱을 실행하고 첫 화면을 검사하는 중…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Logged in or not, which test account, which data must exist. Mention the -uiTesting launch argument if your app seeds state with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "로그인 여부, 어떤 테스트 계정, 어떤 데이터가 있어야 하는지. 앱이 -uiTesting 실행 인자로 상태를 세팅한다면 그것도 적어 주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Message": {
      "comment": "A column that displays the message of a step.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Mode": {
      "comment": "A label for the mode picker in the Claude Assistant.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "NEEDS WORK": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "개선 필요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NO VIOLATIONS": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
